{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_002_02_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:5425ef0c3679d76887c66c492e9fa07081382060e81cc88d33d67cd61459114c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98c7678a340f8aa54a3bbf517cae88065276977b005779af361e450c6e3cf1e4",
      "text": "三明治……真好吃！\n分量也足，嗯——好幸福……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ece0b79338b9467f311eb3400dc37d9fdb9a3dd702dd23c7ca3dab32755be097",
      "text": "（那些菜，他一个人全吃得下吗？\n看分量感觉像是两三人的份）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27800f670348ae4a49ba97eb2a4241a56c1eeb38c0ee1a508c1a2fb1a10b2b66",
      "text": "啊，服务员。\n不好意思，麻烦再加一份拿坡里意面。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5025b9cf7d0c35cc92258954c68a6ce9ee6ba1783c3232c46f2808b16a1dca9d",
      "text": "（……诶！居然还要再加一份拿坡里意面！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_d:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a95cc6cc8b1dfc479d3df656f5cbf80baf9a904c8103b591bc0aa516ed1e2f93",
      "text": "对了，饭后甜点选什么好呢。\n每种蛋糕看起来都很好吃……啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_d:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7db3f25970a94ee059ed826277b87a9d22131bc5d04701e1a1b0b041f09d41f9",
      "text": "“3种披萨套餐”，这个也想吃！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8772084efa69a7a3b95c9e51e30bf3e33d541c8a40c46845014a7b1639b6f2e0",
      "text": "可是，总是叫店员的话，\n稍微有点不好意思呢。唔——……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_d:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3354c3ea6f0954863e18b171dcee0d5f54d87dfc1294e06777c488c9623c0430",
      "text": "可是，好想吃！……不好意思——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_d:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c97ab794efad110308046c21aad467213c1c116e460d169bd5a25e20db76298d",
      "text": "（好幸福的笑容啊。和刚才害怕时的反差，\n简直判若两人……好！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_002dra_02_1_1_002_02:1_1_002_02_d:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30093ead20d3f09511057fb5a29eaa81e9e43e7ca1b2b7bc8d2d802341156b57",
      "text": "那个，打扰您用餐真是不好意思。\n能稍微占用您一点时间聊两句吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
